   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMRC is an independent non-governmental organization (NGO) which focuses on Asian labour concerns. It works to support a democraticand independent labour movement in Asia, promoting the respect of labour rights, gender equality, and active workers# participationin work-related issues.</narrative>
